Comparing transxchange data

The purpose of this log file is to highlight the changes that have occurred from one version of the transxchange data to another.
This will more than likely be a comparison of the latest with the previous, but it can be run against any versions.
It only compares changes in data elements that are used for importing so NptgLocalities, JourneyPatternSections and VehicleJourneys wont be included.
Where a whole file is added or removed, then only the core service description is included.
Where a file is altered, then changes down to property level are described.
Any suggestions for change should be emailed to philmoir@tfl.gov.uk.

